{"ex-E302-1":{"id":"ex-E302-1","chapter":"E302","number":1,"title":"電燈的成本效益","question":"<p>下表列出 LED 燈、緊湊型熒光燈和白熾燈的詳情，全部燈亮度相同。</p><div class=\"study-table-wrap\"><table><tbody><tr><td><p></p></td><td><p>LED 燈</p></td><td><p>緊湊型熒光燈</p></td><td><p>白熾燈</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>功率</p></td><td><p>10 W</p></td><td><p>14 W</p></td><td><p>60 W</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>壽命</p></td><td><p>15 000 小時</p></td><td><p>10 000 小時</p></td><td><p>1000 小時</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>售價</p></td><td><p>$50</p></td><td><p>$40</p></td><td><p>$15</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>假設每 kW h 的電費是 $1.1。</p><p>(a) 哪種燈使用 1000 小時的成本最低？</p><p>(b) 哪種燈使用 15 000 小時的成本最低？</p><p>(c) 與其他兩種燈相比，LED 燈有甚麼優點？</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 使用 LED 燈的成本 = 1.1 × 0.01 × 1000 + 50 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>61</mn><mtext>使用緊湊型熒光燈的成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1.1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.014</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">61 使用緊湊型熒光燈的成本 = 1.1 \\times  0.014 \\times  1000 + 40 = </annotation></semantics></math></span>55.4 使用白熾燈的成本 = 1.1 × 0.06 × 1000 + 15 = $81 ∴ 使用 1000 小時成本最低的是緊湊型熒光燈。</p><p>(b) 使用 LED 燈的成本 = 1.1 × 0.01 × 15 000 + 50 = $215 使用緊湊型熒光燈的成本</p><p>= 1.1 × 0.014 × 15 000 + 2 × 40 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>311</mn><mtext>使用白熾燈的成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1.1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.06</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>15000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">311 使用白熾燈的成本 = 1.1 \\times  0.06 \\times  15 000 + 15 \\times  15 = </annotation></semantics></math></span>1215 ∴ 使用 15 000 小時成本最低的是 LED 燈。</p><p>(c) LED 燈的壽命較長，能源效益較高。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>記得把燈的功率由 W 轉換為 kW。</p><p>提示</p><p>要使用 15 000 小時，需要多於一盞慳電膽及白熾燈。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E302_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"99c58ad2f5a6a872b5130fb50ac2b5270db9df7c1dd09c811b3ae99e19c3d508","segments":[{"page":10,"kind":"question","box":[180.44870000000003,502.9999951171875,557.4487,746.3699951171875],"text":"例 題 1 電燈的成本效益\r\n下表列出 LED 燈、緊湊型熒光燈和白熾燈的詳情，全部燈亮度相同。\r\nLED 燈 緊湊型熒光燈 白熾燈\r\n功 率 10 W 14 W 60 W\r\n壽 命 15 000 小時 10 000 小時 1000 小時\r\n售 價 $50 $40 $15\r\n假設每 kW h 的電費是 $1.1。\r\n(a) 哪種燈使用 1000 小時的成本最低？\r\n(b) 哪種燈使用 15 000 小時的成本最低？\r\n(c) 與其他兩種燈相比，LED 燈有甚麼優點？\r\n"},{"page":11,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4488,56.07611083984375,562.4488,305.6128951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 使用 LED 燈的成本 = 1.1 × 0.01 × 1000 + 50 = $61\r\n使用緊湊型熒光燈的成本 = 1.1 × 0.014 × 1000 + 40 = $55.4\r\n使用白熾燈的成本 = 1.1 × 0.06 × 1000 + 15 = $81\r\n∴ 使用 1000 小時成本最低的是緊湊型熒光燈。\r\n(b) 使用 LED 燈的成本 = 1.1 × 0.01 × 15 000 + 50 = $215\r\n使用緊湊型熒光燈的成本\r\n = 1.1 × 0.014 × 15 000 + 2 × 40 = $311\r\n使用白熾燈的成本 = 1.1 × 0.06 × 15 000 + 15 × 15 = $1215\r\n∴ 使用 15 000 小時成本最低的是 LED 燈。\r\n(c) LED 燈的壽命較長，能源效益較高。\r\n"},{"page":11,"kind":"tips","box":[40,46.49989511718752,181.4488,305.6128951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n記得將燈的功率從 W 轉換\r\n為 kW。\r\n提提你\r\n15 000小時照明需要多於\r\n一個緊湊型熒光燈或白熾\r\n燈。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E302-2":{"id":"ex-E302-2","chapter":"E302","number":2,"title":"平行光束","question":"<p>電筒發出平行光束，光通量是 10 lm。光束垂直照射某平面（圖 a）。</p><p>測光儀放在受光束照射的範圍內，測得的照明度是 400 lx。</p><p>圖 a</p><p>(a) 求受照範圍的面積。</p><p>(b) 現在電筒斜照這個平面，測光儀的讀數變為 332 lx（圖 b）。光束與平面的法線之間的夾角 θ 是多少？</p><p>圖 b</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/c21191065e5d720e0d279a52.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:360.2px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/b2a739b8b79b01548772ca48.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:382.9px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) By <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>E</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Φ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>A</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>A</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Φ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>E</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></p><p>= <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></p><p>= 0.025 m<sup>2</sup></p><p>(b) By <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>E</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>E</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>⊥</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math>cos θ,</p><p>332 = 400 cos θ</p><p>θ = 33.9°</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E302_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"99c58ad2f5a6a872b5130fb50ac2b5270db9df7c1dd09c811b3ae99e19c3d508","segments":[{"page":16,"kind":"question","box":[180.54880000000003,580.9998951171875,557.5488,750.9998951171875],"text":"例 題 2 平行光束\r\n電筒發出平行光束，光通量是 10 lm。光束垂直照射某平面（圖 a）。\r\n測光儀放在受光束照射的範圍內，測得的照明度是 400 lx。\r\n測光儀\r\n光束\r\n圖 a\r\n"},{"page":17,"kind":"question","box":[185.2488,50.49989511718752,562.2488,209.48040771484375],"text":"(a) 求受照範圍的面積。\r\n(b) 現在電筒斜照這個平面，測光儀的讀數變為 332 lx（圖 b）。光束\r\n與平面的法線之間的夾角 θ 是多少？\r\n圖 b\r\nθ\r\n光束\r\n"},{"page":17,"kind":"answer","box":[185.2488,209.48040771484375,562.2488,424.0168951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 根據 E = Φ\r\nA，\r\nA = Φ\r\nE\r\n = 10\r\n400\r\n = 0.025 m2\r\n(b) 根據 E = E⊥cos θ，\r\n 332 = 400 cos θ\r\nθ = 33.9°\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E302-3":{"id":"ex-E302-3","chapter":"E302","number":3,"title":"書桌面的照明度（垂直照射的情況）","question":"<p>電燈位於安娜書桌上 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的正上方，與 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點相距 2 m，光通量為 7500 lm。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的照明度是多少？假設電燈很細小，可視作點光源，且反射可以略去不計。</p><p>書桌</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/2820fbf8b85c11a4fc9812d6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:140.2px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>照明度 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>⊥</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{⊥}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{Φ}{4πr^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>7500</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{7500}{4π \\times  2^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 149 lx</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E302_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"99c58ad2f5a6a872b5130fb50ac2b5270db9df7c1dd09c811b3ae99e19c3d508","segments":[{"page":19,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,483.8568951171875,562.4491,674.1734924316406],"text":"例 題 3 書桌面的照明度（垂直照射的情況）\r\n電燈位於安娜書桌上 X 點的正上方，與 X 點\r\n相距 2 m，光通量為 7500 lm。X 點的照明度\r\n是多少？假設電燈很細小，可視作點光源，\r\n且反射可以略去不計。\r\n"},{"page":19,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,674.1734924316406,562.4491,743.2848951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n照明度 E⊥ = Φ\r\n4πr\r\n2 = 7500\r\n4π × 22 = 149 lx\r\nX\r\n2 m\r\n安娜的書桌\r\n電燈\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E302-4":{"id":"ex-E302-4","chapter":"E302","number":4,"title":"書桌上的照明度（斜向照射的情況）","question":"<p>電燈位於安娜書桌上 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的正上方，與 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點相距 2 m，光通量為7500 lm。求比利書桌上 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的照明度。已知 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">XY</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.5m。假設電燈很細小，可視作點光源，且反射可以略去不計。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/ac1586154209afddcf923701.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:197.8px\"/></p>","answer":"<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>+</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p><p>cosθ = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>E</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Φ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>cos</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>θ</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>π</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>π</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>lx</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/d95f2079696ac2ff8e2d9966.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:144.1px\"></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E302_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"99c58ad2f5a6a872b5130fb50ac2b5270db9df7c1dd09c811b3ae99e19c3d508","segments":[{"page":21,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718752,562.4491,324.33209228515625],"text":"例 題 4 書桌上的照明度（斜向照射的情況）\r\n電燈位於安娜書桌上 X 點的正上方，與 X 點相距 2 m，光通量為\r\n7500 lm。求比利書桌上 Y 點的照明度。已知 XY = 1.5m。假設電燈\r\n很細小，可視作點光源，且反射可以略去不計。\r\nX Y\r\n2 m\r\n1.5 m\r\n安娜的書桌 比利的書桌\r\n電燈\r\n"},{"page":21,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,324.33209228515625,562.4491,467.4998951171875],"text":"題 解\r\nr = •\r\n2 + 1.5 = 2.5 m\r\ncos θ = 2\r\n2.5\r\nE = Φ cos θ\r\n4πr\r\n2 = \r\n7500 × \r\n2\r\n2.5\r\n4π × 2.52\r\n = 76.4 lx\r\n2 2\r\nθ\r\nθ\r\nr\r\nX 1.5 m Y\r\n2 m\r\n電燈\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["answer","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E302-5":{"id":"ex-E302-5","chapter":"E302","number":5,"title":"藍光與綠光","question":"<p>電燈 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的光通量都是 880 lm，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 發出 555 nm 的綠光，額定功率是 40 W；<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 發出 480 nm 的藍光，額定功率是 80 W。</p><p>(a) 比較 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的亮度，並簡單解釋。</p><p>(b) 求每盞燈的光視效能。</p><p>(c) 是綠光還是藍光以較高的功率發出？為甚麼？</p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的光通量相同，所以亮度相同。</p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的光視效能 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>880</mn><mn>40</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{880}{40}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 22 lm W<sup>–1</sup></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的光視效能 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>880</mn><mn>80</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{880}{80}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 11 lm W<sup>–1</sup></p><p>(c) 藍光以較高的功率發出。由於我們的眼睛對藍光的敏感度低於綠光，因此 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 須以較高功率發出藍光，才可以產生與 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 相同的光通量。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E302_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"99c58ad2f5a6a872b5130fb50ac2b5270db9df7c1dd09c811b3ae99e19c3d508","segments":[{"page":25,"kind":"question","box":[185.4488,579.8539951171875,562.4488,746.5849951171875],"text":"例 題 5 藍光與綠光\r\n電燈 A 和 B 的光通量都是 880 lm，A 發出 555 nm 的綠光，額定功\r\n率是 40 W；B 發出 480 nm 的藍光，額定功率是 80 W。\r\n(a) 比較 A 和 B 的亮度，並簡單解釋。\r\n(b) 求每盞燈的光視效能。\r\n(c) 是綠光還是藍光以較高的功率發出？為甚麼？\r\n"},{"page":26,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4488,56.07611083984375,557.4488,237.61289511718746],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) A 和 B 的光通量相同，所以亮度相同。\r\n(b) A 的光視效能 = 880\r\n40 = 22 lm W–1\r\nB 的光視效能 = 880\r\n80 = 11 lm W–1\r\n(c) 藍光以較高的功率發出。由於我們的眼睛對藍光的敏感度低於綠\r\n光，因此 B 須以較高功率發出藍光，才可以產生與 A 相同的光通量。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E302-6":{"id":"ex-E302-6","chapter":"E302","number":6,"title":"LED 燈上的能源標籤","question":"<p>LED 燈的能源標籤（圖 a）及包裝盒上的資料（圖 b）如下所示。</p><p>圖 a 圖 b</p><p>(a) 這 LED 燈的光通量是多少？</p><p>(b) 根據圖 b 的包裝盒，這 LED 燈與 60 W 的 GLS 燈（即白熾燈） 一樣光亮。這 60 W 的 GLS 燈的光視效能是多少？</p><p>(c) 包裝盒顯示的三種燈中，哪種燈最節能？試解釋。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/f98d59fbbbd39f52601bb88d.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:536.9px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 光通量 = 光視效能 × 輸入功率</p><p>= 110 × 6.5</p><p>= 715 lm</p><p>(b) 光視效能 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>715</mn><mn>60</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{715}{60}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 11.9 lm W<sup>–1</sup></p><p>(c) LED 燈最節能，因為它提供相同的光通量所需的功率最小。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E302_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"99c58ad2f5a6a872b5130fb50ac2b5270db9df7c1dd09c811b3ae99e19c3d508","segments":[{"page":26,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,267.1008951171875,557.4491,552.4803009033203],"text":"例 題 6 LED 燈上的能源標籤\r\nLED 燈的能源標籤（圖 a）及包裝盒上的資料（圖 b）如下所示。\r\nLuminous Efficacy\r\n(Lumen/W)\r\n發光效率（流明／瓦）\r\nEnergy Efficiency Grade*\r\n能源效益級別\r\n*Among the five grades.\r\n Grade 1 is the most \r\nenergy efficient.\r\n 在五個級別中，第一級為最省電。\r\n圖 a 圖 b\r\n(a) 這 LED 燈的光通量是多少？\r\n(b) 根據圖 b 的包裝盒，這 LED 燈與 60 W 的 GLS 燈（即白熾燈）\r\n一樣光亮。這 60 W 的 GLS 燈的光視效能是多少？\r\n(c) 包裝盒顯示的三種燈中，哪種燈最節能？試解釋。\r\n"},{"page":26,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,552.4803009033203,557.4491,743.5848951171876],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 光通量 = 光視效能 × 輸入功率\r\n = 110 × 6.5\r\n = 715 lm\r\n(b) 光視效能 = 715\r\n60\r\n = 11.9 lm W–1\r\n(c) LED 燈最節能，因為它提供相同的光通量所需的功率最小。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}